  "body": "HostResolveImportedModule algorithm assumes that the _referencingModule.[[HostDefined]]_ is set to its _referencing module script_ somewhere prior to running the algorithm.\r\n\r\n* Should we clarify where we set the _moduleRecord.[[HostDefined]]_?\r\nI'm not 100% sure where this should be. Maybe in the procedure [_\"create a module script\"_](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#creating-a-module-script)?\r\n\r\n* Should we clarify where we clear the _moduleRecord.[[HostDefined]]_?\r\nIn the [_\"internal module script graph fetching procedure\"_](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#internal-module-script-graph-fetching-procedure) Step 7.1, we clear the _\"module script\"_'s [_\"module record\"_](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-module-script-module-record) to null. Should we clear the _moduleRecord.[[HostDefined]]_ backref to _\"module script\"_ here?",
